player is {x: 20, y: 20, image: "hero"}
coins is []
c is sprite
c.x is 26
c.y is 20
c.image is "coin"
add c to coins
coins are pickups
score is 0
when player picks up any coin
  add 10 to score
ghost is {x: 90, y: 20, speed: 3}
ghosts is []
add ghost to ghosts
ghosts chase player
ghosts are hostile
hits is 0
when player hits any ghost
  add 1 to hits
left is 1
to update
  add 1 to player.x
  left is the number of coins
to draw
  write "s {score} h {hits} g {ghost.x} c {left}" at 2, 2 in white on hud
run game with update and draw
